<tr><td>SMS without a channel strategy</td><td>Separate ab testing SMS duties from email duties</td><td>Ab Testing frequency collision sheds subscribers</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="mt-12">Implementation order for a ab testing program</h2>
<ol>
<li>Record ab testing permission origins in the ESP before sending.</li>
<li>Ab Testing gating: all four commerce events verified live.</li>
<li>Set ab testing guardrails before constructing journeys.</li>
<li>For ab testing, start single-journey with a control group.</li>
